# Cloudflare Pages — full route map
#
# Two rule types are used:
#
#   301/302  Redirect  — browser changes URL (for bare/alias paths with no page)
#   200      Rewrite   — serve directory index without trailing-slash redirect
#                        (prevents CF Pages' internal 301 looping with [[Path]].ts)
#
# Execution order (CF Pages):
#   1. [[Path]].ts edge function  — handles variant→canonical 301s, calls next()
#   2. _redirects                 — consulted when [[Path]].ts calls context.next()
#   3. Static asset serving       — fallback
#
# Rule ordering:
#   - Static redirects (301/302) before dynamic rewrites (200)
#   - More specific paths before splat patterns
#   - First match wins
#
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# BARE-PATH DISPATCHERS (301)
# These paths have no corresponding page file. [[Path]].ts passes them through
# (no canonical match), then _redirects dispatches to the correct sub-route.
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

/Account                  /Account/SignIn           301
/Account/               /Account/SignIn           301
/Legal                    /Legal/Term               301
/Legal/                  /Legal/Term               301
/Contact                  /Contact/Sale             301
/Contact/                /Contact/Sale             301

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# TRAILING-SLASH LOOP PREVENTION (200 rewrites)
# CF Pages would issue a 301 to add a trailing slash for any directory-based
# page (e.g. /Account/SignIn → /Account/SignIn/). The [[Path]].ts function
# strips it back (→ /Account/SignIn), creating an infinite loop.
# 200 rewrites intercept BEFORE CF's trailing-slash logic and serve the
# directory index directly — no redirect, URL stays clean.
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Account ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/Account/ForgotPassword   /Account/ForgotPassword/  200
/Account/ResetPassword    /Account/ResetPassword/   200
/Account/SignIn           /Account/SignIn/           200
/Account/SignUp           /Account/SignUp/           200

# ── Blog (index + dynamic slug pages) ────────────────────────────────────────
/Blog                     /Blog/                    200
/Blog/*                   /Blog/:splat              200

# ── Contact ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/Contact/Sale             /Contact/Sale/            200

# ── Contributing ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/Contributing             /Contributing/            200

# ── Dashboard ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/Dashboard                /Dashboard/               200

# ── Doc (index + dynamic slug pages) ─────────────────────────────────────────
/Doc                      /Doc/                     200
/Doc/*                    /Doc/:splat               200

# ── Download ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/Download                 /Download/                200

# ── Legal ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/Legal/Privacy            /Legal/Privacy/           200
/Legal/Term               /Legal/Term/              200

# ── License ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/License                  /License/                 200

# ── OAuth ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/OAuth/Success            /OAuth/Success/           200

# ── Portal ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/Portal                   /Portal/                  200

# ── Verify ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/Verify                   /Verify/                  200
